1
00:00:05,788 --> 00:00:09,158
United Airlines K9...

2
00:00:09,325 --> 00:00:10,915
(Bernadette:)Waiting for my husband.

3
00:00:11,193 --> 00:00:12,423
(Man in Suit:)That's nice.

4
00:00:13,028 --> 00:00:14,998
(Bernadette:)He's coming back from outer space.

5
00:00:15,865 --> 00:00:18,695
I think this flight is coming from Houston.

6
00:00:20,703 --> 00:00:23,363
(Bernadette:)No, I mean...
Never mind.

7
00:00:26,175 --> 00:00:27,735
(Bernadette:)There he is!
Howie! Howie!

8
00:00:27,943 --> 00:00:30,573
Howie! Howie! Howie!

9
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:36,140
- Howie! Howie! Howie!
- Thank you. Great to be back on Earth.

10
00:00:36,318 --> 00:00:39,078
(Howie Mandel:)Uh, I think they're here for me, Ringo.

11
00:00:41,323 --> 00:00:42,723
(Various others(all at once):)Howie! Howie!

12
00:00:42,958 --> 00:00:45,828
- Mr. Mandel, I'm your driver.
- Oh, thanks.

13
00:00:47,997 --> 00:00:51,527
(Howie Mandel:)That nut job was telling everybody
on the plane he's an astronaut.

14
00:00:51,901 --> 00:00:54,371
(Bernadette:)I missed you so much.

15
00:00:55,538 --> 00:01:01,018
(Howard:)I missed you too.

